WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.878
Your DMS knows 65 things about every unit.

00:00:04.011 --> 00:00:05.979
Only 3 of them make it online.

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:08.713
And listings go stale.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.531
Boat Trader goes 23 days without an update,

00:00:11.551 --> 00:00:14.019
and sold units stay listed.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:17.705
DealerEdge syncs every unit from your DMS,

00:00:17.725 --> 00:00:20.877
and only processes what changed.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.832
AI writes the listing and enhances the photos.

00:00:24.861 --> 00:00:27.015
The model stays the model.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.337
Update the unit once,

00:00:29.357 --> 00:00:30.799
and it syncs to your website,

00:00:30.819 --> 00:00:33.705
Google, and the marketplaces.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.735
Brand MAP rules are enforced:

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.692
a new Moomba listed below its floor is held before it

00:00:40.712 --> 00:00:42.959
publishes.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:48.046
One unit on 5 marketplaces gets 3 times the inquiries.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.875
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
